Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.46,0:00:11.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,I have a friend...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.92,0:00:22.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Are you Nonoa?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.63,0:00:28.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san?!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.96,0:00:30.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,But why?!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.25,0:02:08.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,But why?!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.58,0:02:10.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you look exactly like Coulia.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.75,0:02:11.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.75,0:02:16.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Did things work out between her and Liliel?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.00,0:02:18.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,I guess I could ask later, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.75,0:02:21.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Did you seriously pick a fight with Liliel?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.38,0:02:24.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're not even denying it.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.71,0:02:25.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.50,0:02:27.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that look.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.08,0:02:29.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,If you're not gonna say no,\NI'll take that as a yes!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.38,0:02:30.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.75,0:02:33.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's fine.\NI get where you're coming from.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.04,0:02:37.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,I get being jealous of other girls who\Nare more popular or more attractive.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.21,0:02:38.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm not, though.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.21,0:02:41.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,But, it's gross to punch down, you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.21,0:02:44.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,If you wanna pick a fight with someone,\Nthen aim for the top and go after me!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.50,0:02:46.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,I don't care what people think of me.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.83,0:02:53.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,If they want me to be the bad guy,\NI'll be the bad guy.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.08,0:02:55.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,That means everyone can\Nteam up against me and be friends.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.92,0:02:58.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Everyone wants attention.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.21,0:03:02.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,You might think other cosplayers\Nare fighting you for that attention,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.13,0:03:05.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,but you've got something\Nin common with them:
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.13,0:03:07.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,you had the courage to go out and cosplay.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.92,0:03:11.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's enough to make you an ally.\NA friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.00,0:03:15.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that, okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.63,0:03:22.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.00,0:03:23.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,But, you've...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.25,0:03:25.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.67,0:03:28.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,You can speak?\NWait, what did I get wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.50,0:03:30.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san, you're so freaking cool!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.17,0:03:33.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did you come from?!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.04,0:03:36.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh. So you worked things out.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.21,0:03:39.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, did you hear all that?!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.67,0:03:40.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,What are you, stalking me?!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.92,0:03:42.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,You did so good, Nagomi.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.67,0:03:44.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna remember this when
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.33,0:03:46.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm lying in bed and\Nfall asleep cringing about it!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.38,0:03:47.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Other people do that, too...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.25,0:03:48.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Other people do that, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.50,0:03:49.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,...other people do that, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.17,0:03:53.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.71,0:03:58.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ririsa told me you gave her advice, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.79,0:04:00.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,That was really nice of you.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.88,0:04:05.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah, if you ever need help, just text me...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.25,0:04:07.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,I did it.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.25,0:04:12.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,I said the thing I needed to say.\NI can speak again!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.58,0:04:19.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, you like Liliel too, Nonoa-chan?!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.54,0:04:20.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.88,0:04:22.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm so thrilled!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.29,0:04:23.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah, I've liked her since I was a kid...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.29,0:04:25.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah, I've liked her since I was a kid...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.29,0:04:25.71,Q5,,0,0,0,,I'm speaking, but I'm so nervous.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.71,0:04:26.54,Q6,,0,0,0,,I'm speaking, but I'm so nervous.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.54,0:04:28.17,Q6,,0,0,0,,I haven't had a conversation in so long.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.79,0:04:32.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,And I've never had a friend before.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.21,0:04:35.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,B-but I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.13,0:04:37.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,I know how to talk about this.\NI can talk forever about Liliel.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.21,0:04:38.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Don't do it.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.88,0:04:40.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,You go away!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.04,0:04:42.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,The second you start talking,\Nshe'll stop liking you.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.38,0:04:44.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Where should I start? What should I say?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.92,0:04:47.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,There's just so many things I like,\NI don't know where to start!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.96,0:04:50.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Between the manga, the anime, and the movie,\Nthere's so much I could talk about.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.38,0:04:53.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,But my favorite thing is how\Nshe's so devoted to Lord Ashford!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.54,0:04:56.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,You see female characters\Nlike her in shonen manga, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.25,0:04:57.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Stop avoiding it and remember what happened!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.08,0:05:02.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Like, you just keep rambling,\Nand don't even try to connect it with our conversation.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.92,0:05:07.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's like you don't even listen to us.\NConversation's supposed to go back and forth!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.25,0:05:08.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.75,0:05:12.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,I bet instead of listening,\Nyou're just planning out what you wanna say next.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.75,0:05:15.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's not communication, you know.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.17,0:05:27.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,R-Ririsa-chan, what do you like about Liliel?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.38,0:05:37.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh man, so many things, I can't name just one!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.29,0:05:39.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,I was gonna say the same thing!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.46,0:05:41.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,You totally get it!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.25,0:05:43.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'll go in story order,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.00,0:05:45.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,starting with the prequel episode\Nbundled with the movie DVD pre-order.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.50,0:05:48.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yes! I love that episode!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.08,0:05:50.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,And you know that one awesome scene?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.42,0:05:51.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Totally!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.63,0:05:52.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Right?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.42,0:05:53.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.71,0:05:59.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.46,0:06:01.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're not the villain.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.42,0:06:07.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,You remembered how badly I got hurt,\Nand have been trying to protect me.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.29,0:06:10.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.83,0:06:12.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,And thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.46,0:06:16.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,I wasn't in the wrong. She was.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.83,0:06:21.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's what I believed,\Nbut it wasn't the full truth.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.71,0:06:25.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,She was wrong to say that to me,\Nbut what I did was wrong, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.92,0:06:31.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,And when I didn't want to admit that,\NI used it as an excuse to escape it all.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.17,0:06:33.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,But it's okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.25,0:06:37.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,If I make a mistake,\Nall I have to do is change.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.13,0:06:38.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'll keep evolving.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.58,0:06:43.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,So that's why Liliel's lines in that scene in the\Nnew movie are both a callback to the old movie
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.21,0:06:47.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,AND an answer to the mixed reception the scene\Nin the old movie got when it was released!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.21,0:06:51.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Now when you go back and rewatch the\Nold movie it makes so much more sense!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.79,0:06:53.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ten years out,\Nand Liliel just keeps getting deeper!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.50,0:06:54.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's incredible, really!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.71,0:06:57.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, I keep going on and on...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.75,0:07:03.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,I wasn't that bad, was I?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.33,0:07:04.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,No, you're fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.92,0:07:07.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Then why are you laughing at me?!\NCome on!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.50,0:07:10.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,I won't have that nightmare again...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.50,0:07:15.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,...because today,\NI get to have fun with my friend.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.63,0:07:26.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lost and Found, right?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.75,0:07:28.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Did someone turn in a wallet?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.63,0:07:30.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yes, we have some wallets.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.50,0:07:32.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,We've got lots of items today.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.67,0:07:33.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,What did yours look like?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.75,0:07:37.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,I also lost my phone, my train card holder,\Nmy makeup pouch, and my keys!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.58,0:07:42.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,These are all yours, I think?\NThey got turned in separately, too...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.58,0:07:44.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank god!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.71,0:07:48.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,I always make sure I\Ndon't lose my hairpin,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.58,0:07:51.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,but then everything else goes missing!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.00,0:07:51.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.88,0:07:54.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,You girls are the best.\NThanks!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.54,0:08:01.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,She was super pretty.\NShe looked like she walked right out of a manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.33,0:08:04.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,She's a cosplayer, right?\NI didn't see her walking around, though...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.42,0:08:08.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I didn't.\NHow the heck did we miss her?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.63,0:08:11.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I got pics of Nonoa-chan today!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.21,0:08:13.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,And we got pics of her with Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.38,0:08:15.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Check out this one, the angle is perfect.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.25,0:08:16.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,They're so cute!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.83,0:08:19.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ohmigod, who are they?\NThey're adorbs!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.08,0:08:22.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, that huge crowd of randos was for two girls?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.04,0:08:23.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Randos?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.38,0:08:27.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Liliel and Nonoa, right? Cool, got it.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.21,0:08:29.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,A gyaru just touched me...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.25,0:08:31.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, god, an extrovert.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.63,0:08:33.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,W-what's your handle?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.96,0:08:36.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Handle?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.13,0:08:38.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Um, you're a cosplayer, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.67,0:08:41.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! I literally just started.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.25,0:08:44.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm Aria Kisaki.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.63,0:08:48.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Remember that name, 'cause soon,\NI'm gonna be famous!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.33,0:08:57.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nonoa-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.58,0:09:01.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,R-Ririsa-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.13,0:09:04.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,What cosplay is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.83,0:09:06.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,I-it's just my school uniform.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.33,0:09:07.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.00,0:09:10.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming out after school.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.75,0:09:12.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sure, it wasn't that far away...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.38,0:09:15.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy I could die.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.50,0:09:17.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Thank you for joining us for\Nthe shoot today, Nonoa-san.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.79,0:09:19.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, thank you...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.83,0:09:22.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Actually... Could you drop the formality a little?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.04,0:09:24.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm in the same grade as Ririsa-chan...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.79,0:09:26.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's right, Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.17,0:09:28.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yes, I-I mean, yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.63,0:09:33.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I finally get to take pictures\Nwith another cosplayer at a real studio!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.83,0:09:37.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy I have cosplay friends!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.08,0:09:38.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,M-me too.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.58,0:09:43.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,This is the first time I've gone\Nout with friends after school...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.29,0:09:46.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Isn't renting studio space expensive?\NHow much is it gonna be?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.46,0:09:48.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, actually...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.46,0:09:52.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,This one is run by\NMayura-sama's friend, Chika-chan.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.21,0:09:57.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hey, there.\NAre you the girls Mayura-chan mentioned?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.29,0:10:00.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Gosh, you're young.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.17,0:10:03.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Do I need to call the cops on her?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.04,0:10:04.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nope, she hasn't done anything weird yet!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.71,0:10:06.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, yet?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.13,0:10:08.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know that uniform...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.08,0:10:10.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,You know Ta-chan, the English teacher?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.71,0:10:12.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,He and I are drinking buddies.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.33,0:10:13.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,C-cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.75,0:10:16.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,So you must be her pretty friend, Morichika-san!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.46,0:10:17.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, sweetheart, call me Chika-chan.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.75,0:10:18.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.46,0:10:24.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Mayura had me crossdress anytime she\Nneeded a guy character in her group.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.21,0:10:26.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Keep your mouth shut.\NYou'll ruin the cosplay.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.42,0:10:27.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wow, rude.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.33,0:10:29.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Crossdress...?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.79,0:10:32.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Friends of hers get special discounts.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.42,0:10:36.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,How much would it be for three\Nhours in the Fantasy Room?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.38,0:10:37.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Free fifty, honey.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.58,0:10:38.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.42,0:10:40.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Whatever's not booked is yours to have fun in.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.58,0:10:42.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.79,0:10:45.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,We own the whole building.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.63,0:10:48.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,The tenants on the first and second floors pay rent.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.17,0:10:50.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,I run the studio space here for fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.67,0:10:53.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to cosplay anymore,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.63,0:10:58.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,so the least I can do is help\Nout the up-and-coming newbies.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.21,0:11:01.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,You can pay me back by getting famous, mmkay?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.67,0:11:04.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.63,0:11:07.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,You can recommend me to your friends, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.17,0:11:11.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,I've got a camera and can take pics\Nif they want to come on their own!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.21,0:11:13.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.17,0:11:15.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,You did Mayura-sama's ROMs?!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.75,0:11:17.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Whoa... You don't need me, then.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.17,0:11:19.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Want my help today?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.33,0:11:21.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,No, that's okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.67,0:11:24.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Senpai's the only person\NI trust for pictures of my Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.33,0:11:27.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Aww, you two are cute.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.04,0:11:30.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,If he gets hit by a truck and dies,\Ncall me, mmkay?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.38,0:11:32.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sure! I'll give you a call!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.38,0:11:33.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Should I worry?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.38,0:11:33.54,Q9,,0,0,0,,Dies?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.00,0:11:36.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take pictures for a\Nsolo cosplayer today, actually.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.71,0:11:41.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,She's a newbie looking for friends,\Nbut she's a little weird.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.58,0:11:42.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Weird?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.21,0:11:45.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Let me know if you wanna meet her,\Nand I'll arrange something.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.42,0:11:51.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,So it's a Western fantasy theme!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.33,0:11:55.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,They've got all this antique furniture and props, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.83,0:12:02.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,I can get some great shots by the window.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.42,0:12:05.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ever since Ogino-san's lesson,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.67,0:12:08.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,I've been looking forward to\Nmy next shoot in a studio.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.96,0:12:12.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Senpai's the only person\NI trust for pictures of my Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.42,0:12:16.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,If that's right, then I've really gotta\Nknock it out of the park today.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.54,0:12:20.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, but Cinderella Stars Liliel is modern day,\Nnot Western fantasy.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.29,0:12:22.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Or did Nonoa bring a new costume today?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.63,0:12:26.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nonoa-chan, I hope you didn't\Nhave trouble with the costume.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.92,0:12:29.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sorry to ask you to make one for my series.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.46,0:12:31.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,No, no, it's okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.38,0:12:34.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,I couldn't make the weapon, though...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.46,0:12:36.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Because I put everything\NI had into making this new outfit!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.96,0:12:38.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,I was ready to make anything,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.75,0:12:41.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,so long as I got to be in\Na group with Liliel-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.00,0:12:45.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Also, are you okay with getting\Nyour photos taken by a guy?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.71,0:12:47.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.38,0:12:50.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Mikari-chan said she\Nwanted him to take her picture,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.88,0:12:52.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,so I figured it was okay,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.96,0:12:55.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,and I also don't want anyone\Nbut him taking my picture...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.46,0:12:58.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,but I need to make sure\NI respect how she feels!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.67,0:13:00.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,I didn't even think of that.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.75,0:13:03.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,I figured that was normal for cosplay.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.33,0:13:04.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's normal at events, anyways.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.33,0:13:04.67,Q9,,0,0,0,,I totally didn't expect that!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.67,0:13:06.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's normal at events, anyways.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.33,0:13:08.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,I guess it'd be weird if I were alone with a guy...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.67,0:13:10.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, and it doesn't really matter,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.42,0:13:13.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,'cause Senpai's not interested in girls at all!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.17,0:13:15.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okay. No idea what that means.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.96,0:13:17.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.46,0:13:21.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,I feel like I can trust Okumura-senpai.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.29,0:13:24.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.67,0:13:26.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get changed as fast as the wind!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.50,0:13:28.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,We're gonna knock Senpai's socks off!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.17,0:13:29.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Can we get changed normally?!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.75,0:13:33.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okay, we're ready, Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.58,0:13:35.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sorry about the wait.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.29,0:13:42.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Angelic Airborne Defense Squadron Captain Nokiel!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.71,0:13:44.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.33,0:13:46.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,They're doing the Airborne Defense Squadron\Nfrom the spinoff!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.42,0:13:48.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,There are so many more\Nfemale characters in that series!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.79,0:13:50.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's perfect for a group cosplay!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.58,0:13:51.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,No, more than perfect!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.75,0:13:52.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,How could I have missed this?!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.50,0:13:53.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,How could I have missed this?!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.50,0:13:53.83,Q9,,0,0,0,,Is he okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.83,0:13:56.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's so simple! I'm a fool!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.83,0:13:56.04,Q9,,0,0,0,,We'll get started once he's done freaking out.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.04,0:13:56.96,Q1,,0,0,0,, An utter fool!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.38,0:13:59.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get started.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.08,0:14:03.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okay, Senpai!\NI think the spot by the window could be good!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.58,0:14:10.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,It was hard to tell in the manga and anime,\Nbut Nokiel's a bit taller than Liliel.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:10.96,0:14:13.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's cool seeing it in real life!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.50,0:14:18.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,And the studio set makes it look like\Na scene straight from the anime!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:19.71,0:14:20.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Next up...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.67,0:14:22.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nonoa-chan, can I hug you?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.88,0:14:25.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah, sure!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.33,0:14:26.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nokiel!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.29,0:14:30.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nokiel, thank you!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.92,0:14:32.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Liliel-sama, your ch-chest...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.88,0:14:35.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,This is straight out of the manga!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.25,0:14:38.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Liliel hugged me...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.42,0:14:40.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Senpai, can I see the picture?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.33,0:14:42.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Already? Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.71,0:14:45.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,We look so good!\NYou're incredible, Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.25,0:14:47.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Text this one to me!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.67,0:14:50.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm a little embarrassed to look at pictures of myself...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.13,0:14:54.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,But this is so much fun.\NI'm so happy.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.75,0:15:00.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Um, could you send that picture to me?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.08,0:15:03.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.79,0:15:05.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nokiel's talking to me!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.54,0:15:07.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Cosplay is crazy.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.13,0:15:10.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this is the same person.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.75,0:15:13.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Can I post this picture online?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.50,0:15:14.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sure, go ahead!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.63,0:15:16.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,You've got a social media account?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.50,0:15:17.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Can I see it?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.63,0:15:19.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sure, but it's pretty boring.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.96,0:15:23.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Your feed reminds me
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.63,0:15:25.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,of a house made of plain concrete.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.21,0:15:28.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,I got a lot of followers after\NI was featured on that blog,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.17,0:15:30.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,so I've been too nervous to post anything...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.33,0:15:33.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Tons of people are asking if you're dead.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.67,0:15:35.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Do you have an account, Ririsa-chan?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.33,0:15:37.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've got one!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.79,0:15:40.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's basically a Liliel reaction account though.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.42,0:15:44.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna make an account for my cosplay.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.63,0:15:47.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Liliel doesn't have social media, after all.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.08,0:15:49.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to become an urban legend?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.46,0:15:54.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,I think it's great that Nagomi-san gets\Nto wear all these different outfits...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.50,0:15:58.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,But I don't want people to\Nthink of me when I cosplay.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.33,0:16:00.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,I want to be the character.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.08,0:16:07.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Instead of thinking "Ririsa's here!",\NI want people to think "the real-life Liliel is here!"
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.00,0:16:12.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,She's cosplaying Liliel for the series and fans...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.00,0:16:20.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,I picked Coulia because I wouldn't have to talk,\Nand Nokiel because it looked doable...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.00,0:16:24.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,I didn't put enough thought into this.\NI feel horrible.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.83,0:16:29.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Why did she even want to be friends with me?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.25,0:16:33.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,There's no way she'll like me.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.83,0:16:42.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. That's not right.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.25,0:16:45.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be someone new.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.00,0:16:49.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,I just need to be someone who's\Nworthy of being Liliel's partner.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.38,0:16:55.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nokiel is a knight who's sworn\Nto protect Lilel with her life.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.08,0:17:00.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,She's my first and only friend.\NI'll protect her, no matter what.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.33,0:17:04.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,I will protect you with my life, Liliel-sama.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.04,0:17:09.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,How'd I miss that perfect moment?!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.25,0:17:12.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,No way, Liliel and Nonoa?! For realsies?!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.38,0:17:15.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hold it, Aria-chan, I need to ask if it's okay first!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.92,0:17:16.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.96,0:17:19.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,A voice that loud has to mean trouble...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.13,0:17:24.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I tried to stop her.\NIs it okay if we interrupt?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.96,0:17:26.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,They're really here!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.08,0:17:28.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Can I be your friend?!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.04,0:17:34.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm Aria!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.21,0:17:36.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,I've been looking for you guys!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.08,0:17:37.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,She's gorgeous!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.96,0:17:39.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Look at her big eyes...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.00,0:17:40.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,And her perfect body!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.29,0:17:42.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,A gyaru?! No wonder I'm shivering...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.25,0:17:43.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,What's a gyaru doing here?!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.54,0:17:45.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Y-you were looking for us?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.17,0:17:46.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah, duh!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.08,0:17:51.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,I just started cosplaying,\Nand went to that Cinderella Stars event, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.13,0:17:54.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's where I saw a pic of you guys and ohmigod,\Nit was totally love at first sight!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.71,0:17:56.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,I just had to be friends with you!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.92,0:17:58.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Friends?!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.67,0:18:03.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,I found Nonoa's account,\Nbut her DMs were closed so I couldn't message her.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.83,0:18:06.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,I closed them so I don't get\Nmessages from people like you!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.46,0:18:11.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's crazy we're here at the same time.\NIt's like, destiny, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.75,0:18:14.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,We're basically already friends!\NWhat up, bestie?!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.58,0:18:15.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,O-okay...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.25,0:18:21.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,I nearly died getting there with her,\Nand she got there within five seconds!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.25,0:18:23.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,How is she already hanging off her?!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.25,0:18:25.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Extroverts are truly terrifying...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.58,0:18:28.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, ohmigosh,\Nlet's take photos together!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.67,0:18:31.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,R-right now?! We're kinda...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.71,0:18:32.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.33,0:18:35.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,I don't think you know,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.08,0:18:38.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,but we're actually\Ncosplaying from the same series.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.04,0:18:40.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Your cosplay isn't from the Liliel spinoff, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.67,0:18:42.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Then you can't take pictures with us.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.50,0:18:43.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, really?!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.54,0:18:45.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,C'mon, who cares if we're from the same series?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.54,0:18:47.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,It'll be just like the Avengers!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.17,0:18:49.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Those are all Marvel characters!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.83,0:18:50.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,I give up.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.79,0:18:55.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm an introverted otaku who didn't watch the Avengers
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.54,0:18:59.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,and I don't want to hang out with someone\Nwho compares things to the Avengers.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.17,0:19:00.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nonoa-chan, come back to us!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.46,0:19:03.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Why...?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.50,0:19:06.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Why did a random hyper gyaru\Nhave to show up right now?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.00,0:19:10.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,The whole reason I'm an otaku cosplayer is\Nbecause I don't get along with girls like her.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.67,0:19:11.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nonoa-chan?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.46,0:19:19.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Girls like her like to get in your personal space\Nand use slang you've never even heard of,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.92,0:19:24.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,and at school they act as if they're the\Nbest and otaku are lesser human beings...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.67,0:19:25.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,We can never be friends.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.96,0:19:27.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second, Nonoa-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.92,0:19:29.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Who did this to you?!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.08,0:19:30.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Who's the villain?!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.00,0:19:30.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Give me their name!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.54,0:19:34.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,This girl in my class, Tanaka-san.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.54,0:19:36.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,But she isn't Tanaka-san!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.75,0:19:40.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,You don't know if she's going to be like that!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.29,0:19:41.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.63,0:19:44.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're right, Liliel-chan.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.71,0:19:46.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't be so quick to judge.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.92,0:19:47.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.88,0:19:50.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Give her a chance,\Nmaybe you'll be friends!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.96,0:19:52.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Aria-chan, why did you get into cosplay?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.92,0:19:55.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Is it because you like anime and manga?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.29,0:20:00.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,I-I guess manga?\NI read a lot of it when I was little.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.79,0:20:05.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,But I wanna be a famous cosplayer!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.42,0:20:06.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Famous?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.67,0:20:09.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,You guys just started and you're\Nalready getting up there, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.38,0:20:11.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's why I wanted to find you and hit you up!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.71,0:20:14.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,See? We're completely different species.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:14.79,0:20:18.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,But she's being upfront with us,\Nand she doesn't seem like a bad person!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.29,0:20:20.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.88,0:20:24.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,I was really excited to get to do\Na shoot with the two of us...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.00,0:20:26.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nonoa-chan...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.00,0:20:30.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, geez, the girls are fighting...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.88,0:20:31.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ririsa.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.71,0:20:37.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,I know you want to be nice to everyone,\Nbut you made plans with Nonoa today.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.58,0:20:41.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,You should tell her sorry, but no,\Nand make plans for another time.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.63,0:20:42.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.00,0:20:44.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.88,0:20:48.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Aww, what a guy. You go, girl.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.00,0:20:51.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Besides, when you're going after a girl in a game,\Nyou can only do one route at a time!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.00,0:20:51.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.83,0:20:55.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,He could've done without the example...\NBut if it works for her, then sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.21,0:20:57.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Nonoa-chan...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.08,0:20:58.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Aria-san!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.83,0:21:00.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hey, just call me Aria!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.96,0:21:04.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,If Liliel-chan can't do it, then I'll protect her!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.25,0:21:07.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you look so good!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.04,0:21:08.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,How'd you do your makeup?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.75,0:21:10.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.29,0:21:13.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're thinking, Aria-san.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.67,0:21:15.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're drop-dead gorgeous.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.33,0:21:17.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,I bet you could go outside and\Ninstantly get scouted for modeling.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.17,0:21:20.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nono-pi, you think I'm gorgeous?!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.29,0:21:21.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.13,0:21:22.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Why cosplay, then?!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.71,0:21:24.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're already attractive as you are!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.83,0:21:28.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,If you want to be famous, just be an idol,\Nor a model, or an actress!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.00,0:21:33.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.38,0:21:36.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,It has to be cosplay.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.46,0:21:40.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be on TV or in magazines, just...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.54,0:21:42.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.79,0:21:49.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Well, if you care that much about it,\NI guess we could take pictures together.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.88,0:21:51.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,No way, for real?!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.08,0:21:54.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,I guess if Nonoa's okay with it...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.88,0:21:58.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,So, uh, I'll get changed, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.83,0:22:00.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,But what?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.88,0:22:06.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,T-there's a guy in here.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.54,0:22:08.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,There's a changing room!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.75,0:22:10.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, I forgot!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.00,0:22:12.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,She's shyer about it than Ririsa!
